sequenceDiagram
    actor Admin
    participant UI as Rubric Upload Page
    participant Controller as RubricController
    participant Storage as Laravel File Storage
    participant Extractor as RubricStructureExtractor
    participant OpenAI as OpenAI Responses / Files API
    participant DB as Database

    Admin->>UI: Select official rubric PDF
    UI->>Controller: POST /subjects/{subject}/rubrics
    Controller->>Controller: Validate StoreRubricRequest
    Controller->>Storage: Store original PDF
    Controller->>Extractor: Extract rubric structure
    Extractor->>OpenAI: Upload PDF and request JSON extraction
    OpenAI-->>Extractor: Return structured Dynamic Rubric JSON
    Extractor-->>Controller: Return criteria, max_score, weight
    Controller->>DB: Save rubric as pending_verification
    Controller-->>UI: Redirect to rubric verification
